## K9. Who can give the go-ahead
# a scratch project; sessions: implementer reviewer

$ [implementer's session] handoff away Merge everything.
handoff away: away is the operator's, in a terminal of the operator's own, never in an agent's session
# exit 2

$ handoff away Merge everything.
handoff away: away needs a terminal on stdin: the operator types it, an agent's shell cannot
# exit 2

$ env HANDOFF_ROLE=operator handoff away Merge everything.
handoff away: away needs a terminal on stdin: the operator types it, an agent's shell cannot
# exit 2

$ env HANDOFF_ROLE=reviewer handoff back
handoff back: back is for the operator; the caller's role is reviewer
# exit 2
